  "body": "Welcome to 20 Moko Road, Orewa a brand new, single level home combining quality finishes, smart design, and effortless low maintenance living in the desirable Strathmill development.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home features a light filled open plan kitchen, dining, and living area. Designed for both daily life and entertaining, the high-spec kitchen boasts a large central island, walk-in pantry, and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is exceptional with two distinct spaces: a private central deck accessible directly from the kitchen and two bedrooms, plus a second elevated deck with sweeping neighborhood views.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* 3 Bedrooms & 2 Bathrooms: Includes a master ensuite and a main bathroom with a luxurious freestanding bath.\r\n* Premium Comfort: Underfloor heating in both bathrooms and central ducted air conditioning throughout.\r\n* Smart Layout: Dedicated separate laundry with a built-in tub and off-street parking.\r\n* Peace of Mind: Freehold title with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n* Two Distinct outdoor living / entertaining spaces\r\n\r\nLocation & Directions: Nestled in Orewa's vibrant Strathmill community, you're minutes from Orewa Beach, top schools, local cafes and motorway access. Perfect for downsizers, first home buyers and retirees, couples, or small families.\r\n\r\nViewing access: Set GPS to Mahinga Kai Road, take 1st right (Ara Taha Cresent), 2nd left is Moko Road.   (see map included in the pictures). Access through Flavell Drive is also now open.\r\n\r\nContact us today to schedule your private viewing!",
